# CWC ground rules

Full context: `AGENTS.md` and `CWC_Health_App/` (spec v0.4 = behavior; design ref v1.1 + Figma = look).

1. **Community decides.** Preserve `[PENDING FG]` flags. Do not treat tab names, Help Now contents, distance framing, or emergency-card defaults as final.
2. **Protect IRB data.** Never paste or commit identifiable survey rows (names, emails, IPs, geo). Aggregates only.
3. **Values in every artifact:** ~6th-grade plain language; offline-first; Android-first; no dark patterns; minimal data; peer support as a first-class UI feature.
4. **Cite evidence** when adding requirements (`[PROP]`, `[SURV-M]`, `[SURV-P]`, `[CAB]`, `[LIT]`, `[TEAM]`, `[PENDING FG]`).
5. **Version, don’t overwrite** source docs in `CWC_Health_App/`; bump versions and sync `AGENTS.md` / these rules.
6. **Scope:** Award ends 06/29/2027, ≤$40K, student builders. Out of scope: EHR/portal integration, Spanish, AI answers, clinical assessment, social/gamification, crisis logic beyond static Help Now.
